	"data": "Cover Letter Christopher DiCarlo Chameleon Power\n\nJuly 27, 2020\nChameleon Power\nNovi, MI 48375\nRe: Unity Developer\nDear Hiring Manager,\nI am applying for the position of Unity Developer.\nI am very interested in this position. I believe I am a solid fit for this work, including experience with Unity, C#, version control software, AR/VR, and object-oriented programming.\nI have been studying and developing programs with Unity and C# for the last couple of years and have a high degree of knowledge…",
